## Article 264. Normative act challenge proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article264NormativeActChallenge:
  input challenge content NormativeActChallenge
  output challengeHasStanding content YesNo
  output challengeTimely content YesNo
  output allInterestedPartiesDeemedNotified content YesNo
  output relatedActsMayBeChallenged content YesNo
  output reproductionCaseUsesSimplified content YesNo

scope Article264NormativeActChallenge:
# Standing: affected person or subject of relations where act will be applied
  label standing_affected definition challengeHasStanding under condition
    challenge.actChallengedByAffectedPerson = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label standing_subject definition challengeHasStanding under condition
    challenge.actChallengedBySubjectOfRelations = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label standing_default definition challengeHasStanding equals No

# Normative acts can be challenged during entire period of validity
  label timely definition challengeTimely under condition
    challenge.actStillInForce = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely definition challengeTimely under condition
    challenge.actStillInForce = No
    consequence equals No

# If announcement published timely, all interested parties deemed notified
  label deemed_notified definition allInterestedPartiesDeemedNotified under condition
    challenge.announcementPublished7DaysBeforePreparatory = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Related acts may be challenged in same proceeding
  label related_acts definition relatedActsMayBeChallenged under condition
    challenge.relatedActsAffectDecision = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Act reproducing invalidated act is considered under simplified proceedings
  label reproduction_simplified definition reproductionCaseUsesSimplified under condition
    challenge.actReproducesInvalidatedAct = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label reproduction_default definition reproductionCaseUsesSimplified equals No
```

## Article 265. Consequences of declaring normative act unlawful

```catala
declaration scope Article265NormativeActConsequences:
  input consequences content NormativeActConsequences
  output operativePartMustBePublished content YesNo
  output actLosesForceOnDecisionEntry content YesNo

scope Article265NormativeActConsequences:
# Operative part must be published in official outlet
  label must_publish definition operativePartMustBePublished equals Yes

# Act loses force from moment decision enters into force
  label loses_force definition actLosesForceOnDecisionEntry equals Yes
```

## Article 266. High-level official act challenges

```catala
declaration scope Article266HighOfficialChallenge:
  input challenge content HighOfficialChallenge
  output supremeCourtHasJurisdiction content YesNo
  output panelOfFiveRequired content YesNo
  output grandChamberIsAppellate content YesNo

scope Article266HighOfficialChallenge:
# Supreme Court has jurisdiction for high official challenges
  label supreme_court definition supremeCourtHasJurisdiction under condition
    challenge.subject = HighOfficialSubject.ParliamentNormativeAct
    or challenge.subject = HighOfficialSubject.PresidentialNormativeAct
    or challenge.subject = HighOfficialSubject.ParliamentOrPresidentialAction
    or challenge.subject = HighOfficialSubject.HighCouncilOfJusticeAct
    or challenge.subject = HighOfficialSubject.HighQualificationCommissionAct
    or challenge.subject = HighOfficialSubject.CabinetMinistersReferendumInaction
    consequence equals Yes

# Panel of at least 5 judges required
  label five_judges definition panelOfFiveRequired under condition
    challenge.panelOfAtLeastFiveJudges = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Grand Chamber is appellate instance
  label grand_chamber definition grandChamberIsAppellate under condition
    challenge.isGrandChamberAppeal = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_supreme definition supremeCourtHasJurisdiction equals No

  label default_panel definition panelOfFiveRequired equals No

  label default_appellate definition grandChamberIsAppellate equals No
```

## Article 266-1. Bank-related individual act challenges

```catala
declaration scope Article2661BankActChallenge:
  input challenge content BankRelatedActChallenge
  output filingTimely content YesNo
  output filingDoesNotStayAct content YesNo
  output generalProceedingRequired content YesNo
  output courtMayRelyOnOfficialAssessments content YesNo
  output mayDeclareUnlawfulAndCancel content YesNo
  output cancellationDoesNotRestorePriorStatus content YesNo

scope Article2661BankActChallenge:
# 3-month filing deadline is absolute, no restoration
  label timely definition filingTimely under condition
    challenge.threeMonthsSincePublication = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely definition filingTimely under condition
    challenge.threeMonthsSincePublication = No
    consequence equals No

# Filing does not stay the act
  label no_stay definition filingDoesNotStayAct equals Yes

# General proceeding required (not simplified)
  label general_required definition generalProceedingRequired equals Yes

# Court relies on official assessments unless exception applies
  label rely_on_assessments definition courtMayRelyOnOfficialAssessments under condition
    challenge.reviewException = BankActReviewException.SubstantialProceduralViolation
    or challenge.reviewException = BankActReviewException.ObviouslyErroneousData
    or challenge.reviewException = BankActReviewException.ObviousDiscrepancyOrContradiction
    or challenge.reviewException = BankActReviewException.LackOfAuthorityOrAbuseOfPurpose
    consequence equals No

  label default_rely definition courtMayRelyOnOfficialAssessments equals Yes

# Court may declare act unlawful and cancel
  label may_cancel definition mayDeclareUnlawfulAndCancel equals Yes

# Cancellation does not restore prior bank status
  label no_restoration definition cancellationDoesNotRestorePriorStatus equals Yes
```

## Article 266-2. Bank share sale act challenges

```catala
declaration scope Article2662BankShareChallenge:
  input challenge content BankShareSaleChallenge
  output filingTimely content YesNo
  output filingDoesNotStayAct content YesNo
  output generalProceedingRequired content YesNo
  output courtMayRelyOnOfficialAssessments content YesNo
  output cancellationDoesNotRestorePriorStatus content YesNo

scope Article2662BankShareChallenge:
# 3-month filing deadline is absolute
  label timely definition filingTimely under condition
    challenge.threeMonthsSincePublication = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely definition filingTimely under condition
    challenge.threeMonthsSincePublication = No
    consequence equals No

# Filing does not stay the act
  label no_stay definition filingDoesNotStayAct equals Yes

# General proceeding required
  label general_required definition generalProceedingRequired equals Yes

# Court relies on official assessments unless exception applies
  label exception_applies definition courtMayRelyOnOfficialAssessments under condition
    challenge.reviewException = BankActReviewException.SubstantialProceduralViolation
    or challenge.reviewException = BankActReviewException.ObviouslyErroneousData
    or challenge.reviewException = BankActReviewException.ObviousDiscrepancyOrContradiction
    or challenge.reviewException = BankActReviewException.LackOfAuthorityOrAbuseOfPurpose
    consequence equals No

  label default_rely definition courtMayRelyOnOfficialAssessments equals Yes

# Cancellation does not restore prior status
  label no_restoration definition cancellationDoesNotRestorePriorStatus equals Yes
```

## Article 267. Forced expropriation proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article267ForcedExpropriation:
  input case content ForcedExpropriationCase
  output filingAllowed content YesNo
  output appellateCourtHasJurisdiction content YesNo
  output courtFeeExempt content YesNo
  output generalProceedingRequired content YesNo
  output supremeCourtIsAppealInstance content YesNo

scope Article267ForcedExpropriation:
# Only authorized bodies may file
  label filing_by_authorized definition filingAllowed under condition
    case.filedByAuthorizedBody = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label filing_prohibited definition filingAllowed under condition
    case.filedByAuthorizedBody = No
    consequence equals No

# Appellate administrative court has jurisdiction
  label appellate_jurisdiction definition appellateCourtHasJurisdiction under condition
    case.filedAtAppellateCourt = Yes
    and case.propertyLocatedInJurisdiction = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# No court fee for expropriation claims
  label fee_exempt definition courtFeeExempt equals Yes

# General proceeding required
  label general_proceeding definition generalProceedingRequired equals Yes

# Supreme Court is appellate instance, decisions enter into force immediately
  label supreme_appeal definition supremeCourtIsAppealInstance equals Yes
```
